"<h1 id="inline-berechnungen" data-source-line="1">Inline-Berechnungen</h1>
<p data-source-line="3">Einfache Arithmetik: <span class="inline-calc" title="2+3*4">14</span> und mit Klammern <span class="inline-calc" title="(2+3) * (4 - 1)">15</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="5">Zwei pro Zeile: <span class="inline-calc" title="1+1">2</span> und <span class="inline-calc" title="10/4">2.5</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="7">Vergleich im Ausdruck: <span class="inline-calc" title="1 = 1">true</span> sowie <span class="inline-calc" title="2 &gt;= 3">false</span> und logisch <span class="inline-calc" title="1 = 1 AND 2 = 2">true</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="9">Text: <span class="inline-calc" title="&quot;Mark&quot; + &quot;down&quot;">Markdown</span> und <span class="inline-calc" title="upper('abc')">ABC</span> und <span class="inline-calc" title="length('Wort')">4</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="11">Datum und Dauer: <span class="inline-calc" title="date(2026-01-01) + dur(30d)">2026-01-31</span> und <span class="inline-calc" title="date(2026-01-31) - date(2026-01-01)">30d</span> und <span class="inline-calc" title="dur(1d) + dur(2h)">1d 2h</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="13">Relativ: <span class="inline-calc" title="date(today)">2026-07-15</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="15">Funktionen: <span class="inline-calc" title="sum(5)">5</span>, <span class="inline-calc" title="number('42')">42</span>, <span class="inline-calc" title="choice(1 = 2, 'ja', 'nein')">nein</span>, <span class="inline-calc" title="dateformat(date(2026-01-01), 'dd.MM.yyyy')">01.01.2026</span>, <span class="inline-calc" title="default(1/0, 99)">99</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="17">Fehler: Syntax <span class="inline-calc inline-calc-error" title="2+" data-i18n-title="inlineCalc.error.syntax">⚠︎</span>, Funktion <span class="inline-calc inline-calc-error" title="foo(1)" data-i18n-title="inlineCalc.error.function">⚠︎</span>, Wert <span class="inline-calc inline-calc-error" title="1/0" data-i18n-title="inlineCalc.error.value">⚠︎</span>, Feld <span class="inline-calc inline-calc-error" title="file.size" data-i18n-title="inlineCalc.error.field">⚠︎</span>.</p>
<p data-source-line="19">Escape bleibt Literal: {= 2+2 =}.</p>
<p data-source-line="21">Direkt nach Element: <em>kursiv</em><span class="inline-calc" title="2+2">4</span>.</p>
<table data-source-line="23">
<thead data-source-line="23">
<tr data-source-line="23">
<th>Spalte</th>
<th>Wert</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody data-source-line="25">
<tr data-source-line="25">
<td>Rechnung</td>
<td><span class="inline-calc" title="6*7">42</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="callout callout-note"><div class="callout-header"><span class="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg></span><span class="callout-title" data-i18n="callout.note.title"></span></div><div class="callout-body"><p data-source-line="27">Im Callout: <span class="inline-calc" title="3*3">9</span></p>
</div></div><ul data-source-line="30">
<li data-source-line="30">In der Liste: <span class="inline-calc" title="6/2">3</span></li>
</ul>
<p data-source-line="32">Critic bleibt Critic: <mark class="critic"> markiert </mark> und <span class="critic-comment">Anmerkung</span> und <del class="critic">alt</del><ins class="critic">neu</ins>.</p>
<p data-source-line="34">Leer bleibt Literal: {= =} mittig im Satz, unvollständig auch: {= 2+3 offen.</p>
